<title>TUNISIA: Societe Generale inaugurates Tunis office.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale inaugurates Tunis office.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French bank Societe Generale has inaugurated its representation office in Tunis, bankers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bank's first Vice-President Christian Behaghel was received by Finance Minister Nouri Zorgati at the inauguration. The office has an offshore status.</p>
</text>
